WEBVTT

00:00:03.259 --> 00:00:04.016
An A.I.

00:00:04.016 --> 00:00:08.444
call is logged as an activity of the subject, with the disposition the

00:00:08.444 --> 00:00:11.066
agent chose and a summary in the notes.

00:00:11.066 --> 00:00:13.222
Dispositioned by shows the A.I.

00:00:13.222 --> 00:00:15.203
voice agent and its profile.

00:00:15.203 --> 00:00:17.009
The call here is made up.

00:00:17.463 --> 00:00:18.501
Review A.I.

00:00:18.501 --> 00:00:21.615
conversation opens the transcript, read only.

00:00:21.615 --> 00:00:24.607
The Call recordings page also lists an A.I.

00:00:24.607 --> 00:00:28.453
recording with its transcript, when call recording is on.

